** MMP9200 - LOOP-LABEL RESOLUTION REGRESSION FIXTURE
** F1. opens a labelled FIND loop over ORDER-VIEW (MILL-ORDER); UPDATE (F1.)
** inside it must resolve to the same store, not stay an unresolved gap
** (issue 4.3). DELETE (X9.) uses a label nothing ever opened -- must stay
** an honest unresolved gap rather than a guess.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 ORDER-VIEW VIEW OF MILL-ORDER
  2 ORDER-NO
  2 ORDER-STATUS
END-DEFINE
*
F1. FIND ORDER-VIEW WITH ORDER-STATUS = 'HELD'
  UPDATE (F1.)
END-FIND
*
DELETE (X9.)
END
